- $$$s_1+s_2+\dots+s_k=n$$$ ($$$s_i>0$$$),
- the first post contains the videos: $$$1, 2, \dots, s_1$$$;
- the second post contains the videos: $$$s_1+1, s_1+2, \dots, s_1+s_2$$$;
