The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_{i,1}, a_{i,2}, \ldots, a_{i,n}$$$($$$0 \leq a_{i,j} \leq \frac{n (n-1)}{2}$$$).

It is guaranteed that:

- for all $$$1 \leq i \leq n$$$ $$$a_{i,i} = 0$$$;
- for all $$$1 \leq i < j \leq n$$$ $$$a_{i,j} > 0$$$;
