- L: cyclically shift all columns to the left, formally, set the value of each $$$a_{i, j}$$$ to $$$a_{i, (j\bmod n) + 1}$$$;
- D: cyclically shift all rows down, formally, set the value of each $$$a_{i, j}$$$ to $$$a_{((i - 2)\bmod n) + 1, j}$$$;
