- $$$\operatorname{lca}(\{5\})=5$$$;
- $$$\operatorname{lca}(\{3\})=3$$$;
- $$$\operatorname{lca}(\{4,5\})=2$$$;
- $$$\operatorname{lca}(\{4,3\})=1$$$;
