For some $i$ where $s_{i, i} = \mathtt{1}$, let $Z$ be a set containing all the vertices $j$ where $s_{j, i} = \mathtt{0}$. More formally, $Z = \{j\ |\ 1\le j\le n\text{ and } s_{j, i} = \mathtt{0}\}$. Does $Z$ have any special properties?

