- $tout_p \lt tin_u$
- $tin_u \lt tin_p \lt tin_m$
- $tin_m \lt tout_p \lt tin_v$
- $tin_v \lt tin_p$
- $tout_{LCA} \lt tout_p$

Note that we have precisely $5$ groups, with the $i$-th group consisting of only those nodes which satisfy the $i$-th condition.

