description:
Let's define a value of a string, consisting of letters "XVI", as follows:

•  the value of 'X' is $$$10$$$;
•  the value of 'V' is $$$5$$$;
•  the value of 'I' is $$$1$$$ or $$$-1$$$: $$$-1$$$ if the next position contains a letter 'X' or 'V'; $$$1$$$ otherwise;
