Immediately after the second flip, $s$ minutes of sand will remain in the upper half of the hourglass.

If $s \le k$: the answer is $\max(0, s - m \bmod k)$.

Otherwise, the hourglass cycles with period $2k$. If $(m \bmod 2k) < k$, the answer is $s - m \bmod k$; otherwise the answer is $k - m \bmod k$.

