Sort monsters by combat power. For each monster in order, if you can kill it (its power ≤ your current power), optionally use flip flops to boost your combat power before killing it. Specifically, when killing monster $i$ with $a_i \le c$, you can throw up to $\min(k, c - a_i)$ flip flops at it (each flip flop thrown increases your final gain by 1, since $a_i + o$ is added to $c$ but you spend $o$ flip flops that each add 1 to $a_i$). This way you maximize the total combat power gained.

```cpp
