- 'D': go down, (x, y)  →  (x, y-1);
- 'L': go left, (x, y)  →  (x-1, y);
- 'R': go right, (x, y)  →  (x+1, y).

The robot will do the operations in s from left to right, and repeat it infinite times. Help Fox Ciel to determine if after some steps the robot will located in (a, b).

