Let us define function $f(L, R)$, that gives answer to the query. It looks follows:

• if $L = R$ then $f(L, R) = L$;
• else if $2^{b} ≤ L$, where $b$ — maximum integer such $2^{b} ≤ R$, then $f(L, R) = f(L - 2^{b}, R - 2^{b}) + 2^{b}$;
• else if $2^{b + 1} - 1 ≤ R$ then $f(L, R) = 2^{b + 1} - 1$;
