for $n < 10$ answer will be $n = n - 1 + 1 = 1 * (n + 1) - 1$;

for $n < 100$ answer will be $2 * (n - 9) + 9 = 2 * n - 9 = 2 * n - 10 - 1 + 2 = 2 * (n + 1) - 11$;

