Let's solve the problem using dynamic programming. $z_{mask, i}$ — the maximal probability of Ivans victory if the siths from the $mask$ already fought and the $i$-th sith left alive. To calculate that DP we should iterate over the next sith (he will fight against the $i$-th sith): $[formula]$.

